           Move  RTFCE120-I-Fin-Inst-No-D                               01870099
                                         To    R115ISR0-In-F-I-No       01880099
           Move  'OPERATION-TYPE'        To    R115ISR0-In-From-ST-Type 01890099
           Move  RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D                            01900099
                                         To  R115ISR0-In-From-SC-Code   01910099
           Move  Spaces                  To  R115ISR0-In-From-Contr-Type01920099
      *                                                                 01930099
           Move  'STATUS'                To    R115ISR0-In-To-ST-Type   01940099
           Move  '*'                     To    R115ISR0-In-To-SC-Code   01950099
           Move  Spaces                  To    R115ISR0-In-To-Contr-Type01960099
      *                                                                 01970099
           Move  'VALID-OP-ST'           To    R115ISR0-In-Relation-Type01980099
                                                                        01990099
           Call  'F115ISR0'              Using R115ISR0-Sys-Code-Rel    02000099
                                               R7919999-Error-Area      02010099
           End-Call                                                     02020099
      *                                                                 02030099
           Evaluate True                                                02040099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 02050099
               Move  'D101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02060099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    02070099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02080099
      *                                                                 02090099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 02100099
               Move  'D102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       02110099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    02120099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02130099
      *                                                                 02140099
             When R7919999-Return-OK                                    02150099
             and  R115ISR0-Out-Total-Rows > 1                           02160099
               Move  'VAR1'              To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  02170099
               Move  RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D                        02180099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 02190099
               Move  'TF-SY-STATUS-NOT-UNIQUE'                          02200099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    02210099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       02220099
      *                                                                 02230099
             When other                                                 02240099
               Continue                                                 02250099
      *                                                                 02260099
           End-Evaluate                                                 02270099
           .                                                            02280099
      *                                                                 02290099
       D100-Read-Sys-Code-Rel-Ex.                                       02300099
           Exit.                                                        02310099
