      *        End-If                                                   07970099
               Move  WA-Currency         To    R115IPC0-Currency        07980099
               Move  WA-Percentage       To    R115IPC0-Charge-Pct      07990099
      *                                                                 08000099
           End-Evaluate                                                 08010099
