           Perform H200-Check-Input-Op-Ch-Val                           08790064
      *                                                                 08800027
      * Synchronising database fields and input values:                 08810032
      *                                                                 08820027
      * - taking each occurence on the list of permissible charge types 08830027
      *                                                                 08840017
           Perform varying WA-Ind1                                      08850064
           from +1 by +1 until WA-Ind1   >     R115L060-No-Tab-Occ      08860064
      *                                                                 08870027
      * - and searching for that charge type on the input list.         08880027
      *                                                                 08890017
      *       -----------------------------------------                 08900065
      *                                                                 08910065
               Perform varying WA-Ind2                                  08920067
               from +1 by +1 until                                      08930064
      *                                                                 08940065
      *   a) Matching item found.                                       08950065
      *                                                                 08960065
               (     RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-D  (WA-Ind2)                08970077
                  =  R115L060-Charge-Type      (WA-Ind1)                08980077
               and                                                      08990017
                     RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D (WA-Ind2)                09000079
                  =  R115L060-Charge-Role-Type (WA-Ind1)                09010077
               and                                                      09020077
                     RTFCE120-I-Selected-D     (WA-Ind2)                09030098
                  =  'Y'     )                                          09040065
               or                                                       09050017
      *                                                                 09060065
      *   b) No match found.                                            09070067
      *                                                                 09080065
               (     WA-Ind2                                            09090065
                  >  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A     )                     09100067
      *                                                                 09110067
              End-Perform                                               09120067
