                                         To    R115L060-In-Contract-No  09360017
      *                                                                 09370099
           If RTFCE120-I-Part-Amount-No-I =    'U'                      09380099
             Move  RTFCE120-I-Part-Amount-No-D                          09390099
                                         To    R115L060-In-PA-Seq-No    09400017
           End-If                                                       09410099
      *                                                                 09420099
           Move  RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D                            09430052
