               If R115L060-No-Read       >     R115L060-Read-To         09620094
                 Move  'TF-SY-TABLE-TOO-SMALL-VAR1'                     09630090
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    09640090
                 Move  'VAR1'            To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  09650094
                 Move  R115L060-No-Read  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 09660094
                 Move  'H103'            To    R7919999-Paragraph       09670090
                 Perform Z900-Abend                                     09680090
               Else                                                     09690099
                 Move  R115L060-CA-Currency                             09700099
                                         To    WA-Currency              09710099
