      *################################################################*09800017
       H200-Check-Input-Op-Ch-Val        Section.                       09810064
      *                                                                 09820031
      * Checking that the input charge/role types are valid for the     09830091
      * input operation type:                                           09840031
      *                                                                 09850031
      * - taking each occurence on the input list                       09860031
      *                                                                 09870031
           Perform varying WA-Ind1                                      09880031
           from +1 by +1 until  WA-Ind1  >     RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-A 09890031
      *                                                                 09900031
      * - and searching for this occurence type on the list of          09910031
      *   permissible charge types.                                     09920031
      *                                                                 09930031
      *        -------------------------------------------------------- 09940065
      *                                                                 09950065
               Perform varying WA-Ind2                                  09960067
               from +1 by +1 until                                      09970066
      *                                                                 09980065
      *   a) Mathing item found.                                        09990065
               (     R115L060-Charge-Type      (WA-Ind2)                10000067
                  =  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-D  (WA-Ind1)                10010091
               and                                                      10020091
                     R115L060-Charge-Role-Type (WA-Ind2)                10030091
                  =  RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D (WA-Ind1)     )          10040091
               or                                                       10050065
      *                                                                 10060065
      *   b) No match found.                                            10070067
               (     WA-Ind2                                            10080067
                  >  R115L060-No-Tab-Occ                     )          10090067
      *                                                                 10100067
               End-Perform                                              10110067
      *                                                                 10120067
      *        -------------------------------------------------------- 10130067
      *   If no match found:                                            10140099
      *                                                                 10150099
               If  WA-Ind2               >     R115L060-No-Tab-Occ      10160099
                 Perform H230-Ch-List-Input-Error                       10170099
               End-If                                                   10180099
      *        -------------------------------------------------------- 10190067
      *                                                                 10200031
           End-Perform                                                  10210031
           .                                                            10220031
      *                                                                 10230031
       H200-Check-Input-Op-Ch-Val-Ex.                                   10240064
           Exit.                                                        10250031
                                                                        10260031
      *################################################################*10270057
       H230-Ch-List-Input-Error          Section.                       10280099
      *                                                                 10290099
      *   Searching for matching Charge types only.                     10300099
      *                                                                 10310099
           Perform varying WA-Ind2                                      10320099
           from +1 by +1 until                                          10330099
      *                                                                 10340099
      *   a) Mathing item found.                                        10350099
                 R115L060-Charge-Type      (WA-Ind2)                    10360099
              =  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-D  (WA-Ind1)                    10370099
           or                                                           10380099
      *                                                                 10390099
      *   b) No match found.                                            10400099
                 WA-Ind2                                                10410099
              >  R115L060-No-Tab-Occ                                    10420099
      *                                                                 10430099
           End-Perform                                                  10440099
      *                                                                 10450099
      *    --------------------------------------------------------     10460099
      *                                                                 10470099
      *      If no match is found: Invalid Operaion Type/Charge Type    10480099
      *      combination.  Else:   Invalid Charge-Type/Role Type        10490099
      *      combination.                                               10500099
      *                                                                 10510099
           If  WA-Ind2                   >     R115L060-No-Tab-Occ      10520099
             Move 'TF-SY-OP-VAR1-CH-VAR2-INVALID'                       10530099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    10540099
             Move 'VAR1'                 To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  10550099
             Move 'VAR2'                 To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  10560099
             Move RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D                           10570099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 10580099
             Move RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-D(WA-Ind1)                     10590099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 10600099
             Move 'H201'                 To    R7919999-Paragraph       10610099
             Perform Z900-Abend                                         10620099
           Else                                                         10630099
             Perform H260-Read-Sys-Code                                 10640099
             Move 'TF-SY-ROLE-VAR1-CH-VAR2-INV'                         10650099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Code    10660099
             Move 'VAR1'                 To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)  10670099
             Move 'VAR2'                 To    R400CH01-Message-Key(2)  10680099
             Move  R115ISC0-Description  To    R400CH01-Message-Data(1) 10690099
             Move  R115L060-Charge-Description(WA-Ind2)                 10700099
                                         To    R400CH01-Message-Data(2) 10710099
             Perform Z700-Error-AE                                      10720099
           End-If                                                       10730099
           .                                                            10740099
      *                                                                 10750099
       H230-Ch-List-Input-Error-Ex.                                     10760099
           Exit.                                                        10770099
                                                                        10780099
      *################################################################*10790099
       H260-Read-Sys-Code                Section.                       10800099
