           Evaluate True                                                10970099
             When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 10980099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    10990099
               Move  'H261'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       11000099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       11010099
      *                                                                 11020099
             When R7919999-Return-Error                                 11030099
               Move  'FM'                To    R400CH01-Message-Code    11040099
               Move  'H262'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       11050099
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       11060099
