      *################################################################*11170099
       H300-Synch-Charge-Fields          Section.                       11180064
      *                                                                 11190059
           If    RTFCE120-I-Charge-Type-D  (WA-Ind2)                    11200077
              =  R115L060-Charge-Type      (WA-Ind1)                    11210077
           and   RTFCE120-I-Paying-Party-D (WA-Ind2)                    11220079
              =  R115L060-Charge-Role-Type (WA-Ind1)                    11230077
           and   RTFCE120-I-Selected-D     (WA-Ind2)                    11240077
              =  'Y'                                                    11250067
      *                                                                 11260067
      * Matching item found.                                            11270064
                 Perform H400-Create-Update-Charges                     11280067
      *                                                                 11290059
           Else                                                         11300067
      *                                                                 11310067
      * No match found.                                                 11320067
                 Perform H500-Delete-Charge                             11330067
      *                                                                 11340067
           End-If                                                       11350067
           .                                                            11360059
      *                                                                 11370059
       H300-Synch-Charge-Fields-Ex.                                     11380064
           Exit.                                                        11390059
                                                                        11400059
      *################################################################*11410059
       H400-Create-Update-Charges        Section.                       11420064
      *                                                                 11430099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*11440099
      * Checking that the input charge does not violate                 11450099
      * max/min values.                                                 11460099
      *                                                                 11470099
      * Feilretting: (ndl)                                              11470299
      * Check if percent is input when its not allowed                  11470399
           If  R115L060-MethCalc-Settlement    (WA-Ind1)                11471099
           or  R115L060-MethCalc-Part-Amount   (WA-Ind1)                11472099
               If RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D(WA-Ind2) > 0                11473099
                 Move  'F'         To RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-O(Wa-Ind2)11473199
                 Move  'FELT1'             To    R400CH01-Message-Key(1)11473299
                 Move  'Prosent-Provisjon' To   R400CH01-Message-Data(1)11473399
                 Move  'GL-UGYLDIG-VERDI&' To    R400CH01-Message-Code  11473499
                 Perform  Z700-Error-AE                                 11473599
               End-If                                                   11473699
           End-If                                                       11473799
      * feilretting slutt                                               11474099
      *                                                                 11475099
           If not R115L060-Minimum-Charge(WA-Ind1)  = Zero              11480098
           or not R115L060-Maximum-Charge(WA-Ind1)  = Zero              11490098
               Perform I000-Check-Max-Min-Limits                        11500098
      *                                                                 11510099
           Else                                                         11520099
               Set   SW-Using-Input-Charge                              11530099
                                         To    True                     11540099
               Move  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D(WA-Ind2)                11550099
                                         To    WA-Charge-Amount         11560099
               Move  RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D(WA-Ind2)                 11570099
                                         To    WA-Percentage            11580099
      *                                                                 11590099
           End-If                                                       11600098
      *                                                                 11610099
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*11620099
      * Deciding whether to create new row, update existing row,        11630099
      * or continue without database call.                              11640099
      *                                                                 11650099
      *                                                                 11659299
           If  R115L060-MethCalc-Settlement    (WA-Ind1)                11660099
           or  R115L060-MethCalc-Part-Amount   (WA-Ind1)                11670099
               Perform H410-Check-Charge-Amount                         11680099
           End-If                                                       11690099
      *                                                                 11700099
           If  R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA  (WA-Ind1)                   11710099
           or  R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA  (WA-Ind1)                   11720099
      *        If  RTFCE120-I-Operation-Type-D(1:7)                     11730099
      *                                  =     'SETTLE-'                11740099
      *            Perform H410-Check-Charge-Amount                     11750099
      *        Else                                                     11760099
                   Perform H420-Check-Charge-Pctage                     11770099
      *        End-If                                                   11780099
           End-If                                                       11790099
           .                                                            11800017
      *                                                                 11810017
       H400-Update-Charges-Ex.                                          11820064
           Exit.                                                        11830017
                                                                        11840017
      *################################################################*11850097
       H410-Check-Charge-Amount          Section.                       11860099
      *                                                                 11870099
      *    Evaluate R115L060-Charge-Amount     (WA-Ind1)                11880099
      *          =  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D (WA-Ind2)                11890099
      *    also     R115L060-Charge-Amount     (WA-Ind1)                11900099
      *                                                                 11910099
      *      When True                                                  11920099
      *      also Any                                                   11930099
      *        Continue                                                 11940099
      *                                                                 11950099
      *      When False                                                 11960099
      *      also Zeroes                                                11970099
      *        Perform H440-Create-Charge                               11980099
      *                                                                 11990099
      *      When False                                                 12000099
      *      also Any                                                   12010099
      *        Perform H450-Update-Charge                               12020099
      *                                                                 12030099
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 12040099
      *                                                                 12040199
      *    Skriver om litt..........                                    12040299
      *                                                                 12040399
      *    Amount allready registered                                   12040499
           If R115L060-Charge-Amount (WA-Ind1) > 0                      12041099
              If R115L060-Charge-Amount (WA-Ind1)                       12041199
                 Not =  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D (WA-Ind2)            12042099
      *          We update amount                                       12043099
                    Perform H450-Update-Charge                          12044099
              End-If                                                    12045099
           Else                                                         12046099
      *    new amount?                                                  12047099
              If RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D (WA-Ind2)  > 0              12048099
                 Perform H440-Create-Charge                             12049099
              End-If                                                    12049199
           End-If                                                       12049299
           .                                                            12050099
      *                                                                 12060099
       H410-Check-Charge-Amount-Ex.                                     12070099
           Exit.                                                        12080099
                                                                        12090099
      *################################################################*12100099
       H420-Check-Charge-Pctage          Section.                       12110099
      *                                                                 12124099
      *    There exists something                                       12125099
           If R115L060-Charge-Percentage (WA-Ind1) > 0                  12130099
           or R115L060-Charge-Amount     (WA-Ind1) > 0                  12130199
              If R115L060-Charge-Percentage (WA-Ind1)                   12131099
                 Not =  RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D  (WA-Ind2)            12140099
      *          Percent is changed                                     12140199
                 Perform H450-Update-Charge                             12141099
              End-If                                                    12142099
              If R115L060-Charge-Amount (WA-Ind1)                       12143099
                 Not =  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D (WA-Ind2)            12144099
      *          Amount is changed                                      12145099
                 Perform H450-Update-Charge                             12146099
              End-If                                                    12147099
           Else                                                         12150099
              If RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D  (WA-Ind2) > 0               12150199
              Or RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D (WA-Ind2) > 0               12150299
      *       We have a new charge                                      12151099
                 Perform H440-Create-Charge                             12152099
              End-If                                                    12153099
           End-If                                                       12154099
                                                                        12160099
      *                                                                 12160199
      *    Evaluate R115L060-Charge-Percentage (WA-Ind1)                12161099
      *          =  RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D  (WA-Ind2)                12162099
      *    also     R115L060-Charge-Percentage (WA-Ind1)                12163099
      *                                                                 12164099
      *      When True                                                  12170099
      *      also Any                                                   12180099
      *        Continue                                                 12190099
      *                                                                 12191099
      *      When True                                                  12192099
