      *          If RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D (WA-Ind2) Not =          12193499
      *             R115L060-Charge-Amount (WA-Ind1)                    12193599
      *             Perform H450-Update-Charge                          12193799
      *          End-If                                                 12193899
      *        Else                                                     12193999
      *          If RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D (WA-Ind2) > 0            12194099
      *             Perform H440-Create-Charge                          12194299
      *          End-If                                                 12194399
      *        End-If                                                   12195099
      *                                                                 12200099
      *      When False                                                 12210099
      *      also Zeroes                                                12220099
      *                                                                 12221099
      *         If  R115L060-Charge-Amount     (WA-Ind1)  > 0           12222099
      *             Perform H450-Update-Charge                          12223099
      *         Else                                                    12224099
      *             Perform H440-Create-Charge                          12230099
      *         End-If                                                  12231099
      *                                                                 12240099
      *      When False                                                 12250099
