      *################################################################*13840098
       I000-Check-Max-Min-Limits         Section.                       13850098
      *                                                                 13860098
      * Checking that the input charge does not violate                 13870098
      * max/min values.                                                 13880098
      *                                                                 13890098
           If  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D      (WA-Ind2)                13941099
                                         =     Zero                     13942099
           and RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D       (WA-Ind2)                13943099
                                         not = Zero                     13944099
      *                                                                 13945099
             Perform I100-Find-CA-Or-PA-Amount                          13950098
             Compute                           WA-Amount-Check          13960098
                 =                             WA-CA-Or-PA-Amount       13970098
                 *                             RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D13980098
                                                               (WA-Ind2)13990098
                 /                             100                      14000098
             End-Compute                                                14010098
      *                                                                 14020098
           Else                                                         14030098
             Move  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D  (WA-Ind2)                14040098
                                         To    WA-Amount-Check          14050098
      *                                                                 14060098
           End-If                                                       14070098
      *                                                                 14080098
      *    ------------------------------------------------------------ 14090099
      *                                                                 14100099
           If        R115L060-Minimum-Charge(WA-Ind1)                   14110099
               <=    WA-Amount-Check                                    14120099
           and (     WA-Amount-Check                                    14130099
               <=    R115L060-Maximum-Charge(WA-Ind1)                   14140099
               or                                                       14150099
                     R115L060-Maximum-Charge(WA-Ind1)                   14160099
                                         =     Zero                     14170099
               )                                                        14180099
      *                                                                 14190099
           Then                                                         14200099
               Set   SW-Using-Input-Charge                              14210099
                                         To    True                     14220099
               Move  RTFCE120-I-Charge-Amount-D(WA-Ind2)                14230099
                                         To    WA-Charge-Amount         14240099
               Move  RTFCE120-I-Percent-Comm-D(WA-Ind2)                 14250099
                                         To    WA-Percentage            14260099
      *                                                                 14270099
           Else                                                         14280098
               If    WA-Amount-Check                                    14290099
                   < R115L060-Minimum-Charge(WA-Ind1)                   14300099
                   Set   SW-Using-Min-Charge                            14310099
                                         To    True                     14320099
                   Move  R115L060-Minimum-Charge(WA-Ind1)               14330099
                   to    WA-Charge-Amount                               14340099
               Else                                                     14350099
                   Set   SW-Using-Max-Charge                            14360099
                                         To    True                     14370099
                   Move  R115L060-Maximum-Charge(WA-Ind1)               14380099
                   to    WA-Charge-Amount                               14390099
               End-If                                                   14400099
      *ndl feilretting - beregn prosent utfra max/min beløp             14400199
      *lg kommenterer bort feilretting fordi den åpner for omkostning   14400299
      *lavere enn min provisjonssats                                    14400399
      *        If  R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-CA  (WA-Ind1)               14400499
      *        or  R115L060-MethCalc-Pct-Of-PA  (WA-Ind1)               14400599
      *            If WA-CA-Or-PA-Amount = 0                            14400699
      *               Perform I100-Find-CA-Or-PA-Amount                 14400799
      *            End-If                                               14400899
      *            Compute                     WA-Percentage            14401099
      *               =                        WA-Charge-Amount         14402099
      *               *                        100                      14403099
      *               /                        WA-CA-Or-PA-Amount       14405099
      *            End-Compute                                          14406099
      *        End-If                                                   14407099
               Move  Zero                To    WA-Percentage            14410099
      *ndl feilretting slutt                                            14411099
      *                                                                 14420099
           End-If                                                       14430098
           .                                                            14440098
      *                                                                 14450098
       I000-Check-Max-Min-Limits-Ex.                                    14460098
           Exit.                                                        14470098
                                                                        14480098
